{\hich\ai\ab\dbch\ai\ab\loch\i\b\par}\pard\plain \s47\sl480\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\fi0\li86\lin86\ri86\rin86\sb86\sa86\ltrpar\cf0\rtlch\af2\afs24\alang1033\ltrch\hich\af2\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af2\langfe2052\loch\f2\fs24\lang1033\qj\widctlpar\tx720\tqr\tx9360\hyphpar1\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa432{
